# Aatchik, Emerald Radian dealt lethal damage at the same time as another Insect it controls: its "whenever another Insect you control dies"
# still triggers, looking back to before the event (CR 603.10a, and the ruling), so each opponent loses 1 life; the +1/+1 counter has no
# Aatchik to go on (CR 400.7). Bot1's Black Lotus in its graveyard makes one Insect on turn one; Bot2's Slagstorm on turn two deals 3 to
# each creature, killing the 3/3 Aatchik and the 1/1 Insect together. Bot2 is at 19.

